          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He holds out a hand without opening his eyes.* You did not mention it. Good. *He takes the stone, weighs it, and does not give it back.* Then that part is finished. There is a kama on the rock behind you; it has been there since you first came up. Bring it here."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 5,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": [
            {
              "__struct_id": 0,
              "Active": {
                "type": "resref",
                "value": ""
              },
              "Index": {
                "type": "dword",
                "value": 6
              },
              "IsChild": {
                "type": "byte",
                "value": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Orovan sits with his hands open on his knees.* The first thing is done and you are none the wiser, which is correct. The unbreathing form, the still point, the open palm that stops a blade -- those are all later, and I will not be hurried up a mountain. Sit if you like. The wind drops after noon."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 6,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": [
            {
              "__struct_id": 0,
              "Active": {
                "type": "resref",
                "value": ""
              },
              "Index": {
                "type": "dword",
                "value": 6
              },
              "IsChild": {
                "type": "byte",
                "value": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He inclines his head a fraction and says nothing else. Somewhere below, the wind moves through the last of the trees.*"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 7,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": []
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He has you set down everything you are holding on the bare rock, and then everything you are holding that is not in your hands, which takes rather longer. At the end of it he gives you a plain cord with nothing on it.* Wear that. When you find yourself wondering what it is for, you will have the answer."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 8,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": []
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He puts the pebble into your palm and closes your fingers over it himself.* Do not look after it. Do not lose it on purpose either; that is the same mistake wearing a different coat."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 9,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": []
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The kama is plain, dark-hafted, and the stone is set flush into the butt of the handle where the hand will never feel it.* Now it is a tool and you are a person, and neither of you is remarkable. That is the whole of the first lesson. Go down before the light goes."
          }
        }
      }
